rth Side)<BR><b>Kelethin Book Loc is:  Greater Faydark:  </b>neg 175, neg 750<br><BR><b>Neriak Pedestal Loc is:  </b>neg 910, pos 130 (South Side)<BR><b>Neriak Book Loc is:  Nextulos Forest: </b> pos 735, neg 345<br><BR><b>Nexus Pedestal Loc is:  </b>pos 450, neg 75 (North Side)<BR><b>Nexus Book Loc is:  Nexus:</b>  pos 45, pos 475 (West Tunnel)<br><BR><b>Oggok Pedestal Loc is:  </b>neg 910, pos 455 (South Side)<BR><b>Oggok Book Loc is:  Feerrott: </b> pos 875, neg 160<br><BR><b>Overthere Pedestal Loc is:  </b>neg 910, pos 885 (South Side)<BR><b>Overthere Book Loc is:  Overthere:</b>  pos 3135, pos 1930<br><BR><b>Paineel Pedestal Loc is:  </b>neg 910, pos 1225 (Southwest Side)<BR><b>Paineel Book Loc is:  Toxxulia Forest:  </b>neg 2345, pos 285<br><BR><b>Plane of Tranquility Pedestal Loc is:  </b>neg 150, neg 325 (East Side)<BR><b>Plane of Tranquility Book Loc is:  Plane of Tranquility:  </b>pos 770, neg 1440<br><BR><b>Qeynos Pedestal Loc is:  </b>pos 150, neg 325 (East Side)<BR><b>Qeynos Book Loc is:  North Qeynos:</b>  pos 200, pos 485<br><BR><b>Rivervale Pedestal Loc is:  </b>pos 910, pos 1225 (Northwest Side)<BR><b>Rivervale Book Loc is:  Misty Thicket: </b> neg 555, neg 1260<br><BR><b>Shar Vahl Pedestal Loc is:  </b>pos 360, neg 325 (East Side)<BR><b>Shar Vahl Book Loc is:  Shadeweaver's Thicket: </b> neg 3005, neg 2425<br><BR><b>Soulbinder Jera: </b> neg 210, neg 50<br><BR><b>Succor Point: </b> neg 148, neg 285</font>
